  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Occidental Petroleum more than tripled, leading these choices. Apple gained, but Amazon lost about one-third. The US share basket also finished lower, while bonds gained. The opening month’s excitement about the internet did not describe every business, and it did not make all online investments successful.",
