  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Online shopping, technology wealth and executive rewards filled the news. An oil-drilling dispute showed that older industries still mattered too.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "The seven investments followed different paths. Bonds gained while the broad US basket fell, and even the two technology-related companies had different results.",
    "what_faded_away": "A famous leader’s reward and an online-shopping stunt did not predict five-year returns. Public attention was not the same as investment value.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Nobody knew the final ranking or the crises ahead. It would have been easy to overlook a less fashionable industry while reading exciting technology stories.",
